TITLE Albite kinetics pH2 200C with Fe2/Fe3 and H2S gas fixed P
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    pe 4
    Fe(3) 4e-3
    Fe(2) 4e-3
    -water 1

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5

KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 1000 in 100
        -tol 1e-12

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.csv
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step ionic_strength
10 PUNCH STEP_NO, MU
END
